itsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T01:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T01:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pressure tested cement hose and LTV to 20/345bar for 5/10 min. Confirmed line up</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T01:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T02:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Checked annulus pressure at wellhead 10bar. Started to pressure up tubing w/ cement unit with constant rate. Observed pressure drop after reaching 28 bar indicating that plug opened. Stopped pumping, pressure in tubing stabilized at 13 bar. Annulus pressure at wellhead went up and stabilized to 13 bar.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T02:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T02:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Bled off tubing pressure above DHSV to zero and monitored for buildup, no build up observed. Applied 520bar to the control line to open DHSV. Pressured up well w/ cementing unit. Observed indications of equalizing and openning of DHSV both on cement unit and on pressure gauge on control fluid pump. Stopped pumping. Bled off well to zero pressure. Annulus pressure 2 bar. No indications of gas below DHSV/in the well observed. Confirmed zero pressure below DHSV. Closed DHSV</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T02:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T03:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3055</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RD swedge, LTV and cement hose. Meanwhile held TBT for pulling tubing hanger free</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T03:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T03:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3055</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pressured upTHRT line to 2000psi and then bled down to 500 psi to release TH</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T03:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T03:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3055</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U to 166t , neutral weight, continued to P/U to 170t, TH released (5t overpull). Continued to POOH, observed +/-  20t drag, disconnected control hoses, RIH before start breaking and L/D landing string</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T03:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T04:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3034</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>L/D landing string and THRT. Meanwhile held TBT for installing power slips and control line reel</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T04:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T05:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3034</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed power slips and positioned control line reel</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T05:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T06:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3002</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH w/ 7in tubing from 3034m 3002m</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T06:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3002</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Repaired hydraulic hose for Flush mounted slips</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-22T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-22T07:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3002</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:sta